# Frontend dev environment.
#
# No environment variables are currently required to run the frontend.
# Copy this to .env.local only if you need to add one later.
#
# Requests go to a relative /api, which next.config.ts rewrites to
# http://localhost:3002/api. That rewrite is hard-coded, not read from env.
#
# NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL appears in some older .env.local files but has no
# references anywhere in src/ — it is vestigial and setting it does nothing.
